nd analysis-defined strata. Intervals are nominal and not fully adjusted for the larger history of exploratory subgroup testing, even though this final panel was limited and focused. Overlap at median cutpoints, missingness in Cas9/age/growth variables, and residual confounding among correlated genomic and technical features limit mechanistic or generalizable interpretation. No validation is requested because independent validation capacity is exhausted.",
