ysis and appraise, I will accept only if every comparison cell has at least 20 observations and the signed 95% lower bound is clearly above +0.15 composite dependency-score units in the registered direction; borderline results will remain unresolved. All claims are dataset-internal measured associations only, not causal, mechanistic, single-gene, pathway, or generalizable conclusions."
