ss is the main context-specific predictor. I also reassess H273 as reject and close: its interaction interval crosses zero and is not threshold-supported, and with validation capacity exhausted it is better described as unsupported rather than active. H296 remains unresolved but closed because its interval is positive and nearly threshold-supportive but does not meet the pre-specified rule; this is not evidence against an effect. No validation is requested because independent validation capacity is exhausted. All accepted claims remain dataset-internal measured associations among measured predictors and analysis-defined strata only; they do not establish causality, mechanism, single-gene knockout effects, pathway effects, or generalizability.",
